Subject: CPMS I02B Direction-Aware Generation Constraint Ledger

@ [ledger_uuid] e7ad1f58-a994-43ee-b7ee-62f24c4865e5

& [Must] is deterministic and bounded
  + fresh generator per root with explicit contract
  + split and normalize root and definitions
  + merge same-direction names only on byte equality
  + lexical maps, sets, traversal, and canonical object keys
  + local-only reference closure with visited and active sets
  + direct self cycles only for ProcedureType and ProcedureValue
  + check every profile 0.1 counter and canonical byte ceiling
  + domain-separate definition root and universe fingerprints
  + fail without partial universe

& [MustNot] preserves stage boundaries
  - never: publish self-contained canonical document or golden bundle in I02B
  - never: parse untrusted JSON bytes, validate instances, retrieve references, or cross direction
  - never: read Git, filesystem, clock, environment, process, service, network, provider, model, persistence, effect, or hardware

& [Stop] on extra dependency, source-touch expansion, unstable name, collision, unresolved reference, external reference, unexpected mutual cycle, counter exhaustion, fingerprint ambiguity, default drift, or failed gate

